OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina's Xi Jinping, US President Donald
OL,7,FTrump and Russia's Vladimir Putin have
OL,8,Fbeen pictured together for the first
OL,9,Ftime in Shenzhen
OL,11,FImages show the three leaders shaking
OL,12,Fhands, and host Xi hugging Trump on the
OL,13,Ftarmac as he arrived in the country
OL,14,Fearlier on Wednesday
OL,16,FThey're together for the Asia-Pacific
OL,17,FEconomic Co-operation (Apec) summit
OL,19,FXi has called the Russian leader an
OL,20,F"old friend", and the pair will hold
OL,21,Fhistoric talks with Trump on Thursday
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
